\par
\cf1 D'Developer - 
Version 1.0\cf0  is a window version of \cf1 The Premier Developer - Version 8.0 \cf0 which is an integrated multi-user computer solution package designed specifically for the property development industry and has been successfully implemented in leading
 housing development companies throughout Malaysia..\par
\par
Full package of the \cf1 D'Developer - Version 1.0\cf0  is comprising of the following seventeen (17) modules and are categorised to three (3) major groups:\par
